        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Best place we have ever stayed. Every detail imaginable was taken care of. The communication with Justin was top notch. Can’t say enough good things about the house. Lots of an attention to detail. The pool was the kids favorite and the golf cart was so helpful for the short ride to the beach. Beautifully decorated and just the best place to stay! We will be back!",
