      {
        "author": "Gail W.",
        "date": "2025-07-07T21:48:15Z",
        "id": "686c9af7ffc49d431197f473",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "The Dune Retreat was incredible for our family of 17. This luxurious home is so unique and beautiful with large gathering spaces, super nice kitchen for cooking and eating in, large bedrooms and bathrooms, very clean, and the elevator was a plus. The pool/spa was great and the game room and movie room were used a lot! Having 3 decks was wonderful...the kids could swim on the first floor, and on the third floor deck, you could read where it was quiet. We even had an outdoor movie night with our grandkids on the 3rd floor deck. The 6 seat golf cart was a bonus! Everything was fantastic!\nI can not say enough nice things about Justin and Meg. They were the most gracious, kind, and attentive hosts ever!\nJustin immediately answered every inquiry I had in the months before our trip. We called a couple of times during our stay, and he, Meg, and Jeremy came right away to address our concerns and went above and beyond to make sure we were comfortable. This was the perfect choice for our wonderful family vacation!!!",
        "title": "Perfection in every way!"
      }
